OpenWindows Built-in Commands:
  owhelp    - Show this help
  owls      - List directory contents
  owcat     - Display file contents
  owps      - List running processes
  owsh      - Launch shell
  owreboot  - Reboot system
  owhalt    - Halt system
  owdmesg   - Show kernel messages
  owlsmod   - List loaded modules
  owlspci   - List PCI devices

